## Configuration

Configuration is handled through the `config/default.json` file and environment variables.

### Environment Variables

- `LOG_LEVEL` - Set logging level (debug, info, warn, error)
- `TIMEOUT` - Set operation timeout in milliseconds
- `NODE_ENV` - Set environment (development, production)

